# Paste a token from POST /api/v1/auth/login (never commit real tokens)
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = PASTE_AN_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### (customer) What would my cart cost with this code?
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/coupons/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SAVE10"
}

### (admin) Create a percentage coupon: 10% off, max 50 off, cart of at least 100, 100 uses
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SAVE10",
  "type": "percentage",
  "value": 10,
  "minOrderAmount": 100,
  "maxDiscountAmount": 50,
  "usageLimit": 100,
  "expiresAt": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### (admin) Create a fixed coupon: 25 off
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WELCOME25",
  "type": "fixed",
  "value": 25
}

### (admin) List coupons
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/coupons?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### (admin) Stop a coupon (the code itself cannot be changed)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/coupons/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### (admin) Remove the usage limit
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/coupons/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usageLimit": null
}

### (admin) Delete a coupon (orders that used it keep the code and the discount)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/coupons/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Checkout with a coupon
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingAddress": "12 Nile St, Mansoura, Egypt",
  "couponCode": "SAVE10"
}
